Haan bhai. 25 employees ke liye screenshots + continuous screen recordings dono rakhne hain, to main Cloudflare R2 Standard suggest karunga. Current R2 pricing $0.015/GB-month hai, 10 GB/month free storage hai, aur internet egress free hai.

📦 25 employees ka estimate

Agar hum wahi planning assumption rakhein:

25 employees
8 hours/day
~26 working days/month
~2 GB recording per employee/day
Screenshots ka storage recording se separate

To recording storage roughly:

25 × 2 GB × 26 = ~1,300 GB/month = ~1.3 TB/month

Isliye main minimum 2 TB R2 capacity planning rakhunga, taaki screenshots + growth ke liye bhi room rahe.

💰 Approx R2 monthly cost

R2 Standard:

1,300 GB × $0.015 ≈ $19.50/month

10 GB free tier ke baad roughly $19.35/month, plus applicable operation charges if your usage exceeds the included request quotas. R2 includes 1 million Class A and 10 million Class B operations monthly, while egress is free.

Roughly ₹1,700/month ke aas-paas storage cost maan sakte ho, exchange rate/taxes ke hisaab se actual amount change hoga.

🔥 Main setup aise rakhunga

Cloudflare R2 Standard

🎥 Screen recordings → R2
📸 Screenshots → R2
🗄️ Employee/activity metadata → existing backend database
🗑️ 30-day automatic retention → old recordings/screenshots delete
📈 Storage usage ke according bill



